{"data":{"body":"[P1] Reject container checkpoints for virtual children\n\nVirtualness is not part of `OperationIdentifier`. If a previously non-virtual `run_in_child_context` changes to `ChildConfig(is_virtual=True)`, its existing CONTEXT checkpoint passes validation and this method returns the cached result without executing the virtual body, so the changed hierarchy is never validated. When `self.is_virtual`, reject any existing container checkpoint before terminal handling, and add a non-virtual-to-virtual replay test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7p5vKk","finding_digest":"856e8305ec1ad93cdd36952739c09f74587b246a0c47360b9f8d015fd8f3922a","finding_id":"arf_v1_qvxigbpmdlmtzxjwsutttqe7or","finding_key":"operation/child.py::childoperationexecutor.check_result_status::virtual-mode-must-not-consume-container-checkpoints","identity_key":"operation/child.py::childoperationexecutor.check_result_status::virtual-mode-must-not-consume-container-checkpoints","line":86,"observation_digest":"966efc6d9552aec9146fde0c1f27b1b0d2707c97e5eda9f229eb3ebc1cb806cf","observation_id":"aro_v1_szxpy3mvkkxmsfdp3ygb6j5rwd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/operation/child.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_qvxigbpmdlmtzxjwsutttqe7or","published_at":"2026-09-03T11:54:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_46uiqxk3wj75r6k2y2mhzk2f3h","reviewed_base_sha":"ea0bc35cef49b694999c0c2578ad3c76a381f844","reviewed_head_sha":"ed0d2429fe7c2e574925366f902e9fbdafaa1128","reviewer":"codex","start_line":86,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":698},"record_id":"art_v1_2hg3kb3vvxowyii5ojtykwjevl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T11:54:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
